{"id": "math2-2015-20", "html": "<p>（本题满分 11 分）</p><p>已知高温物体置于低温介质中，任一时刻该物体温度对时间的变化率与该时刻物体和介质的温差成正比。现将一初始温度为\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:.6833em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:.6741em\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span>\n的物体在\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:.6833em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:.6741em\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span>\n的恒温介质中冷却，\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:.6679em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">min</span></span></span></span></span>\n后该物体降至\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:.6833em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:.6741em\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span>\n。若要将该物体的温度继续降至\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:.6833em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:.6741em\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span>\n，还需冷却多长时间？</p><div class=\"answer-container td-max-width-on-larger-screens\"></div>", "source": "https://www.csgraduates.com/study_methods/math/math2/2015/#20", "section": "解答题", "points": 11}